  "description": "<div class=\"flex max-w-full flex-col grow\">\r\n<div class=\"min-h-8 text-message relative flex w-full flex-col items-end gap-2 text-start break-words whitespace-normal [.text-message+&]:mt-1\" dir=\"auto\" data-message-author-role=\"assistant\" data-message-id=\"80a3bc41-1085-43f9-afb1-7a1d8165adb1\" data-message-model-slug=\"gpt-5-2\">\r\n<div class=\"flex w-full flex-col gap-1 empty:hidden first:pt-[1px]\">\r\n<div class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert w-full break-words dark markdown-new-styling\">\r\n<p data-start=\"63\" data-end=\"379\">Deze <strong data-start=\"68\" data-end=\"122\">Funko Pop! Pin DC Comics Bombshells #12 – Catwoman</strong> is een stijlvol <strong data-start=\"139\" data-end=\"157\">verzamelobject</strong> uit de populaire DC Bombshells-lijn. Het ontwerp is geïnspireerd op de iconische retrostijl van de jaren ’40 en toont Catwoman in een opvallende Bombshells-uitvoering, ideaal voor fans van DC Comics en Funko-verzamelaars.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"381\" data-end=\"466\">De Funko Pop Pin verkeert in <strong data-start=\"410\" data-end=\"438\">Zo Goed Als Nieuw (ZGAN)</strong> staat en is netjes bewaard.</p>\r\n<hr data-start=\"468\" data-end=\"471\">\r\n<p data-start=\"473\" data-end=\"488\">⭐ <strong data-start=\"475\" data-end=\"488\">Voordelen</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"489\" data-end=\"667\">\r\n<li data-start=\"489\" data-end=\"554\">\r\n<p data-start=\"491\" data-end=\"554\">🐱 Officiële Funko Pop! Pin uit de DC Comics Bombshells-serie</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"591\">\r\n<p data-start=\"557\" data-end=\"591\">🎨 Uniek retro Bombshells-design</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"592\" data-end=\"637\">\r\n<p data-start=\"594\" data-end=\"637\">📌 Geschikt om te dragen of te verzamelen</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"638\" data-end=\"667\">\r\n<p data-start=\"640\" data-end=\"667\">✨ Zo Goed Als Nieuw staat</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"669\" data-end=\"672\">\r\n<p data-start=\"674\" data-end=\"694\">📋 <strong data-start=\"677\" data-end=\"694\">Specificaties</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"847\">\r\n<li data-start=\"695\" data-end=\"710\">\r\n<p data-start=\"697\" data-end=\"710\">Merk: Funko</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"711\" data-end=\"742\">\r\n<p data-start=\"713\" data-end=\"742\">Serie: DC Comics Bombshells</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"743\" data-end=\"762\">\r\n<p data-start=\"745\" data-end=\"762\">Modelnummer: 12</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"763\" data-end=\"786\">\r\n<p data-start=\"765\" data-end=\"786\">Personage: Catwoman</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"787\" data-end=\"811\">\r\n<p data-start=\"789\" data-end=\"811\">Type: Funko Pop! Pin</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-start=\"812\" data-end=\"847\">\r\n<p data-start=\"814\" data-end=\"847\">Staat: Zo Goed Als Nieuw (ZGAN)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"849\" data-end=\"852\">\r\n<p data-start=\"854\" data-end=\"872\">📦 <strong data-start=\"857\" data-end=\"872\">Meegeleverd</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"927\">\r\n<li data-start=\"873\" data-end=\"927\">\r\n<p data-start=\"875\" data-end=\"927\">Funko Pop! Pin DC Comics Bombshells #12 – Catwoman</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-start=\"929\" data-end=\"932\">\r\n<p data-start=\"934\" data-end=\"995\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">🛡️ <strong data-start=\"938\" data-end=\"956\">Incl. Garantie</strong><br data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"959\">Incl. Garantie: <strong data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"995\" data-is-last-node=\"\">1 maand garantie</strong></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"border-token-border-light my-2 flex gap-10 border-t pt-4\">\r\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden h-12 w-12 rounded-lg\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"> </div>",
